# Read by ripgrep (and the search tools built on it), NOT by git — everything
# listed here is still committed, because GitHub Pages serves it.
#
# These are bulk data and minified build output. A text search through them
# never answers a question you actually had: it just costs a few hundred
# thousand tokens and buries the real hit. Delete a line if you genuinely need
# to grep one of them, or pass --no-ignore for a single search.

# 22 MB of VEX part meshes, committed twice (the app's public/ copy and the
# build's copy of it — Vite copies public/ verbatim, so both have to exist).
vex-build-center/parts/
vex-build-center-app/public/parts/

# Minified bundles. The source they were built from is in *-app/src.
classroom/assets/
vex-build-center/assets/

# Per-slide state fixtures, regenerated by the course builds.
ai101/slide-states.json
pxp101/slide-states.json

# Decks. Binary.
*.pptx
